<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Command plans merger with Cairn.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Command plans merger with Cairn.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Command Petroleum Holdings NL said on Wednesday it had agreed to merge with United Kingdom-based oil production and exploration firm Cairn Energy Plc.</p>
<p>Command said the cash offer from Cairn values it at A$365 million, while the scrip offer values the group at A$375 million.</p>
</text>
